EM, esencial y profundo. Descubre cu\u00e1ntas veces te has despertado y observa tus tendencias para saber si est\u00e1s cumpliendo tus objetivos. Lo \u00fanico que no hace por ti es contar ovejitas.<\/p><h2>Reimaginado. Reluciente.<\/h2><p>watchOS 10 exprime cada mil\u00edmetro de la pantalla del Apple Watch. Casi todas las apps se han redise\u00f1ado para mostrar m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n de un vistazo. El Grupo Inteligente te permite recorrer widgets desde cualquier esfera. Adem\u00e1s, las prestaciones de salud mental y visual te ayudan a cuidar cuerpo y mente desde la mu\u00f1eca.<\/p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"APPLE","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.24,"unit_price":225.84,"unit_price_tax":225.84,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Apple","sub_category":"Apple Watch","quantity":2,"brand":"APPLE","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_apl-watch%20mxew3qlbardera_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":220.84}}},"0195949647307":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0195949647307",false],"wholesale_price":[241.2,false],"price":[246.2,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["2 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.25",false],"images":["No images",true],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:223109","Cat. IDs: 75,76","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 75","New images created","-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Apple Watch SE 3rd V2\/ GPS\/ Cellular\/ 40mm\/ Caja de Aluminio Medianoche\/ Correa Depor